a de la Marina Alta. El municipi està format pels nuclis de Benirrama, Benialí, Benissivà, Benitaia, la Carroja, Alpatró, Llombai i Benissili i té l''ajuntament a Benialí. El 2025 tenia 585 habitants.","source_url":"https://socdepoble.net/2022/11/17/aplec-pel-territori-2023/","wikipedia_title":"La Vall de Gallinera","wikipedia_url":"https://ca.wikipedia.org/wiki/La_Vall_de_Gallinera","wikidata_id":"Q1768862","population":"583 hab","population_year":2025,"lat":38.8222222,"lng":-0.2222222,"elevation":295,"area":53.6,"gentilici":"vallera / valler","image_url":"/assets/towns/la-vall-de-gallinera/commons-ah27.webp","avatar_url":"/assets/towns/la-vall-de-gallinera/commons-ah27.webp","image":true,"imatges":{"hero":{"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/81/Vall_de_Gallinera.JPG","fitxer":"Vall de Gallinera.JPG","amplada":1280,"alcada":960,"autor":"No machine-readable author provided. Joseaperez assumed (based on copyright claims).","llicencia":"CC BY-SA 3.0","llicenciaUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/","fontUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Vall_de_Gallinera.JPG"},"avatar":{"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/81/Vall_de_Gallinera.JPG","fitxer":"Vall de Gallinera.JPG","amplada":1280,"alcada":960,"autor":"No machine-readable author provided. Joseaperez assumed (based on copyright claims).","llicencia":"CC BY-SA 3.0","llicenciaUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/","fontUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Vall_de_Gallinera.JPG"},"reserva":null},"copyright":"Text: Viquipèdia CC BY-SA 4.0 · Foto: No machine-readable author provided. Joseaperez assumed (based on copyright claims). (CC BY-SA 3.0)","hydration_version":2,"wikipedia_hydration":{"version":2,"checked_at":"2026-11-05T02:00:59+00:00","missing":[],"source_url":"https://ca.wikipedia.org/wiki/La_Vall_de_Gallinera","status":"verified"},"wikipedia_provenance":{"wikidata_url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1768862","wikidata_revision":2553593164,"wikipedia_page_id":55301,"wikipedia_revision":39042397,"scope":"municipality","photo":{"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/81/Vall_de_Gallinera.JPG","fitxer":"Vall de Gallinera.JPG","amplada":1280,"alcada":960,"autor":"No machine-readable author provided. Joseaperez assumed (based on copyright claims).","llicencia":"CC BY-SA 3.0","llicenciaUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/","fontUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Vall_de_Gallinera.JPG"},"text_license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","exceptions":[]},"imageSrc":"/assets/towns/la-vall-de-gallinera/commons-ah27.webp","sectionId":"pobles","searchText":"la vall de gallinera la vall de gallinera es un municipi del pais valencia i una de les valls de l''interior de la comarca de la marina alta. el municipi esta format pels nuclis de benirrama, beniali, benissiva, benitaia, la carroja, alpatro, llombai i benissili i te l''ajuntament a beniali. el 2025 tenia 585 habitants. 583 hab town"},{"id":"pego","type":"town","title":"Pego","author":"Gent de Pego","provincia":"Alacant","comarca":"La Marina Alta","content":"Pego és un municipi del País Valencià situat a la comarca de la Marina Alta a la província d''Alacant té una població de 10.295 habitants segons dades de 2022. Ha estat històricament centre de la vall que porta el seu nom i també de les poblacions de les valls veïnes de la comarca. El rei Pere III d''Aragó va crear la baronia de Pego (1262) i la va repoblar amb colons barcelonins segons documentació de l''època (Carta de poblament de 1279). Ha estat cap de partit judicial i ha pertangut a les demarcacions històriques de la governació de Xàtiva fins al 1707, quan passà a formar part de la de Dénia i ja el 1833, amb la divisió provincial, després d''uns anys a l''efímera província de Xàtiva, passà a pertànyer a la província d''Alacant.","source_url":"https://socdepoble.net/2022/11/17/aplec-pel-territori-2023/","wikipedia_title":"Pego","wikipedia_url":"https://ca.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pego","wikidata_id":"Q102835","population":"10791 hab","population_year":2025,"lat":38.8430556,"lng":-0.1175,"elevation":82,"area":52.85,"gentilici":"pegolí / pegolina","image_url":"/assets/towns/pego/commons-ah27.webp","avatar_url":"/assets/towns/pego/commons-ah27.webp","image":true,"imatges":{"hero":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/84/Pego%2C_Marina_Alta%2C_Pa%C3%ADs_Valenci%C3%A0.JPG/1920px-Pego%2C_Marina_Alta%2C_Pa%C3%ADs_Valenci%C3%A0.JPG","fitxer":"Pego, Marina Alta, País Valencià.JPG","amplada":1600,"alcada":1123,"autor":"Joanbanjo","llicencia":"CC BY-SA 3.0","llicenciaUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","fontUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pego,_Marina_Alta,_Pa%C3%ADs_Valenci%C3%A0.JPG"},"avatar":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/84/Pego%2C_Marina_Alta%2C_Pa%C3%ADs_Valenci%C3%A0.JPG/1920px-Pego%2C_Marina_Alta%2C_Pa%C3%ADs_Valenci%C3%A0.JPG","fitxer":"Pego, Marina Alta, País Valencià.JPG","amplada":1600,"alcada":1123,"autor":"Joanbanjo","llicencia":"CC BY-SA 3.0","llicenciaUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","fontUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pego,_Marina_Alta,_Pa%C3%ADs_Valenci%C3%A0.JPG"},"reserva":null},"copyright":"Text: Viquipèdia CC BY-SA 4.0 · Foto: Joanbanjo (CC BY-SA 3.0)","hydration_version":2,"wikipedia_hydration":{"version":2,"checked_at":"2026-11-05T02:00:59+00:00","missing":[],"source_url":"https://ca.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pego","status":"verified"},"wikipedia_provenance":{"wikidata_url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q102835","wikidata_revision":2540463587,"wikipedia_page_id":26857,"wikipedia_revision":37736089,"scope":"municipality","photo":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/84/Pego%2C_Marina_Alta%2C_Pa%C3%ADs_Valenci%C3%A0.JPG/1920px-Pego%2C_Marina_Alta%2C_Pa%C3%ADs_Valenci%C3%A0.JPG","fitxer":"Pego, Marina Alta, País Valencià.JPG","amplada":1600,"alcada":1123,"autor":"Joanbanjo","llicen